dts/qcom-msm8974-microsoft-common.dtsi is unmodified from
KorelisLabs/lumia-1520-mainline (MIT, see dts/LICENSE.upstream-1520).

lk2nd-patches/ apply against Mainline4Lumia/lk2nd (BSD-3-Clause);
see each patch file for details.

kernel/0001-lumia930-uefi-parking-smp.patch adds GPL-2.0-only Linux
backend code, with SPDX identifiers in the added sources.
kernel/0002-lumia930-data-only-mmc.patch and mmc-audit-read-only.patch modify
GPL-2.0 Linux MMC/SDHCI sources and add GPL-2.0-only guards; their common-DTS
changes derive from the MIT source credited above. kernel/test-data-policy.py
and test-mmc-ro-policy.py are GPL-2.0-only.
the supplied kernel configs are build configuration, not copies of Linux
source files.

alpine/lk/ contains original BSD-3-Clause sources with SPDX identifiers;
see alpine/lk/LICENSE for their copyright and full license. alpine/lk-menu.patch targets the BSD-3-Clause
Mainline4Lumia/lk2nd tree. the remaining original Alpine scripts/tests/docs use
the project MIT license. downloaded Alpine packages and generated private
images retain their respective upstream licenses; they are not distributed.

status-screen/gen-font.py generates a bitmap header from the Linux
GPL-2.0 font source at build time. generated headers and binaries are not
included in this repository; the MIT license above does not relicense
that upstream font.
